    "created_at": "2022-07-08T02:01:52Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-07-08T02:12:13Z",
    "body": "> Adding scripting support has been discussed in the past: #2502\r\n\r\nCorrect. I see some differences in this approach:\r\n-  Pure rust\r\n- it's not a full scripting / templating solution\r\n- shouldn't have the potential to run code\r\n  - so less exposed to vulnerabilities\r\n - should be faster (without the overhead of calling a external compiler/interpreter)\r\n- It doesn't exclude the possibility of a module for scripting",
    "author_association": "NONE",
